<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Special Met - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Special Met - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 30.49		vs	   31.10</p>
<p> Operating	  800    million    vs	  564    million</p>
<p> Current	    675    million    vs	  325    million</p>
<p> Net		  355    million    vs	  215    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.44 yen	  vs	    5.10 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     42 million	  vs	  42 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sumitomo Special Metals Co Ltd is a medium-size maker of resistors.</p>
</text>
